flowchart TD
    %% =====================
        %% Lobby / Table Lifecycle
        %% =====================
        AppStart[启动 App] --> Auth[登录 / 游客进入]
        Auth --> Lobby[进入大厅]

        Lobby --> Mode{选择模式}
        Mode -->|快速开始| FindTable[匹配牌桌]
        Mode -->|普通 / VIP 桌| FindTable
        Mode -->|赛事| FindTable

        FindTable --> EnterTable[进入牌桌]

        %% 牌桌规则配置(进入后先拿到配置快照，客户端据此渲染与校验)
        EnterTable --> TableConfig[获取牌桌规则配置快照<br/>Blinds/Ante/Straddle/Buy-in/计时/抽水/断线等]
        TableConfig --> ConfigItems[规则项-示例<br/>- SB/BB/Ante/Straddle-可选<br/>- 最小/最大买入、最小带出<br/>- 桌人数/可观战/入局规则<br/>- 行动时长/TimeBank/超时惩罚<br/>- 加注规则-最小加注、上限、全下处理<br/>- 抽水/服务费-Rake-与封顶<br/>- 断线/坐出策略与离桌结算<br/>- 补码/再买入规则-立即/下局生效]
        ConfigItems --> BuyInGate{是否已买入/带入?}
        BuyInGate -->|否| BuyIn[选择买入金额 / 带入筹码]
        BuyInGate -->|是| SeatAssign[选座/自动分配座位]
        BuyIn --> SeatAssign

        SeatAssign --> PlayerState{玩家状态}
        PlayerState -->|观战| Spectate[观战-不参与牌局]
        PlayerState -->|坐下 Sit| SitDown[坐下]
        PlayerState -->|坐出 Sit-out| SitOut[坐出-暂离]

        Spectate --> SeatAssign
        SitOut --> SeatAssign

        SitDown --> BlindJoinGate{入桌规则}
        BlindJoinGate -->|等待大盲| WaitBB[等待 BB 再入局]
        BlindJoinGate -->|补盲| PostBlind[补盲-Post BB/Dead SB]
        WaitBB --> HandStartGate
        PostBlind --> HandStartGate

        HandStartGate{开局条件满足?<br/>>=2个有效玩家} -->|否| WaitMore[等待更多玩家/恢复] --> HandStartGate
        HandStartGate -->|是| HandInit[新一局初始化]

        %% 离桌/退出
        SeatAssign --> LeaveIntent{是否离桌?}
        LeaveIntent -->|否| HandStartGate
        LeaveIntent -->|是| LeaveGate{是否在手中/已投入筹码?}
        LeaveGate -->|是| LeaveLater[标记: 本局结束后离开]
        LeaveGate -->|否| LeaveNow[立即离开并结算带出]
        LeaveLater --> TableExit[返回大厅]
        LeaveNow --> TableExit

        %% =====================
        %% Hand Lifecycle (State Machine)
        %% =====================
        HandInit --> AssignBtn[移交/确定 Button]
        AssignBtn --> ForcedBets[强制下注<br/>SB/BB/可选Ante/Straddle]
        ForcedBets --> DealHole[发手牌-每人2张]

        %% Preflop
        DealHole --> StreetPre[Preflop 下注轮]

        %% Betting Round Template
        StreetPre --> TurnGatePre[轮到玩家行动-按位置]
        TurnGatePre --> ActionTimerPre[开始倒计时]
        ActionTimerPre --> ActionChoicePre{玩家动作}
        ActionChoicePre -->|Fold| Folded[弃牌]
        ActionChoicePre -->|Check| CheckPre[过牌]
        ActionChoicePre -->|Call| CallPre[跟注]
        ActionChoicePre -->|Bet| BetPre[下注]
        ActionChoicePre -->|Raise| RaisePre[加注]
        ActionChoicePre -->|All-in| AllInPre[全下]
        ActionTimerPre -->|超时| AutoActionPre[自动处理<br/>优先Check否则Fold]

        %% 每次动作后：更新状态、底池、最小加注、行动权
        Folded --> UpdateStatePre[更新玩家状态/底池/轮次]
        CheckPre --> UpdateStatePre
        CallPre --> UpdateStatePre
        BetPre --> UpdateStatePre
        RaisePre --> UpdateStatePre
        AllInPre --> SidePotPre[生成/更新主池与边池]
        AutoActionPre --> UpdateStatePre
        SidePotPre --> UpdateStatePre

        UpdateStatePre --> EarlyWinPre{是否只剩一人未弃牌?}
        EarlyWinPre -->|是| WinNoShow[直接获胜<br/>无需摊牌]
        EarlyWinPre -->|否| RoundEndPre{下注轮是否结束?<br/>都已跟注/过牌/全下}
        RoundEndPre -->|否| TurnGatePre
        RoundEndPre -->|是| AllInRunoutGate{剩余玩家是否都已全下?}
        AllInRunoutGate -->|是| Runout[补齐公共牌<br/>直接发Flop/Turn/River]
        AllInRunoutGate -->|否| DealFlop[发翻牌 Flop-3张]

        %% Flop
        DealFlop --> StreetFlop[Flop 下注轮]
        StreetFlop --> TurnGateFlop[轮到玩家行动] --> ActionTimerFlop[开始倒计时] --> ActionChoiceFlop{玩家动作}
        ActionChoiceFlop -->|Fold| Folded
        ActionChoiceFlop -->|Check| CheckFlop[过牌]
        ActionChoiceFlop -->|Call| CallFlop[跟注]
        ActionChoiceFlop -->|Bet| BetFlop[下注]
        ActionChoiceFlop -->|Raise| RaiseFlop[加注]
        ActionChoiceFlop -->|All-in| AllInFlop[全下]
        ActionTimerFlop -->|超时| AutoActionFlop[自动处理]
        CheckFlop --> UpdateStateFlop[更新状态/底池/轮次]
        CallFlop --> UpdateStateFlop
        BetFlop --> UpdateStateFlop
        RaiseFlop --> UpdateStateFlop
        AutoActionFlop --> UpdateStateFlop
        AllInFlop --> SidePotFlop[生成/更新主池与边池] --> UpdateStateFlop
        UpdateStateFlop --> EarlyWinFlop{是否只剩一人?}
        EarlyWinFlop -->|是| WinNoShow
        EarlyWinFlop -->|否| RoundEndFlop{下注轮结束?}
        RoundEndFlop -->|否| TurnGateFlop
        RoundEndFlop -->|是| AllInRunoutGate2{是否都全下?}
        AllInRunoutGate2 -->|是| Runout
        AllInRunoutGate2 -->|否| DealTurn[发转牌 Turn-1张]

        %% Turn
        DealTurn --> StreetTurn[Turn 下注轮]
        StreetTurn --> TurnGateTurn[轮到玩家行动] --> ActionTimerTurn[开始倒计时] --> ActionChoiceTurn{玩家动作}
        ActionChoiceTurn -->|Fold| Folded
        ActionChoiceTurn -->|Check| CheckTurn[过牌]
        ActionChoiceTurn -->|Call| CallTurn[跟注]
        ActionChoiceTurn -->|Bet| BetTurn[下注]
        ActionChoiceTurn -->|Raise| RaiseTurn[加注]
        ActionChoiceTurn -->|All-in| AllInTurn[全下]
        ActionTimerTurn -->|超时| AutoActionTurn[自动处理]
        CheckTurn --> UpdateStateTurn[更新状态/底池/轮次]
        CallTurn --> UpdateStateTurn
        BetTurn --> UpdateStateTurn
        RaiseTurn --> UpdateStateTurn
        AutoActionTurn --> UpdateStateTurn
        AllInTurn --> SidePotTurn[生成/更新主池与边池] --> UpdateStateTurn
        UpdateStateTurn --> EarlyWinTurn{是否只剩一人?}
        EarlyWinTurn -->|是| WinNoShow
        EarlyWinTurn -->|否| RoundEndTurn{下注轮结束?}
        RoundEndTurn -->|否| TurnGateTurn
        RoundEndTurn -->|是| AllInRunoutGate3{是否都全下?}
        AllInRunoutGate3 -->|是| Runout
        AllInRunoutGate3 -->|否| DealRiver[发河牌 River-1张]

        %% River
        DealRiver --> StreetRiver[River 下注轮]
        StreetRiver --> TurnGateRiver[轮到玩家行动] --> ActionTimerRiver[开始倒计时] --> ActionChoiceRiver{玩家动作}
        ActionChoiceRiver -->|Fold| Folded
        ActionChoiceRiver -->|Check| CheckRiver[过牌]
        ActionChoiceRiver -->|Call| CallRiver[跟注]
        ActionChoiceRiver -->|Bet| BetRiver[下注]
        ActionChoiceRiver -->|Raise| RaiseRiver[加注]
        ActionChoiceRiver -->|All-in| AllInRiver[全下]
        ActionTimerRiver -->|超时| AutoActionRiver[自动处理]
        CheckRiver --> UpdateStateRiver[更新状态/底池/轮次]
        CallRiver --> UpdateStateRiver
        BetRiver --> UpdateStateRiver
        RaiseRiver --> UpdateStateRiver
        AutoActionRiver --> UpdateStateRiver
        AllInRiver --> SidePotRiver[生成/更新主池与边池] --> UpdateStateRiver
        UpdateStateRiver --> EarlyWinRiver{是否只剩一人?}
        EarlyWinRiver -->|是| WinNoShow
        EarlyWinRiver -->|否| RoundEndRiver{下注轮结束?}
        RoundEndRiver -->|否| TurnGateRiver
        RoundEndRiver -->|是| Showdown[进入摊牌 Showdown]

        %% Runout (all players all-in)
        Runout --> Showdown

        %% Showdown / Payout
        Showdown --> RevealGate[亮牌流程<br/>可简化: 全员亮牌]
        RevealGate --> HandEval[计算牌力<br/>每人最优5张]
        HandEval --> PotOrder[按主池/边池顺序结算]
        PotOrder --> SplitGate{是否平分底池?}
        SplitGate -->|是| SplitPot[平分/按筹码规则处理余数]
        SplitGate -->|否| SingleWin[分配给赢家]
        SplitPot --> Settle[更新筹码/余额/统计]
        SingleWin --> Settle
        WinNoShow --> Settle

        Settle --> HandHistory[记录 Hand History / 回放事件]
        HandHistory --> PostHand[手后处理<br/>移交Button/清理状态]
        PostHand --> RebuyGate{是否补码/再买入?}
        RebuyGate -->|是| Rebuy[补码/自动补码-可选] --> NextHandGate
        RebuyGate -->|否| NextHandGate

        NextHandGate{继续下一局?<br/>且>=2有效玩家} -->|是| HandInit
        NextHandGate -->|否| SeatAssign

        %% =====================
        %% Reconnect / Timeout Side Flows
        %% =====================
        %% 断线可能发生在任意阶段：保留座位/手牌状态，继续计时
        AnyPhase[任意阶段] -.-> Disconnect[断线] -.-> MarkDC[标记离线/启动离线倒计时]
        MarkDC -.-> DCInHand{是否在手中?}
        DCInHand -.->|是| DCAuto[按计时自动行动<br/>Check/Fold]
        DCInHand -.->|否| DCSitOut[自动坐出/保持观战]
        Disconnect -.-> Reconnect[重连] -.-> SyncState[下发桌面快照<br/>仅本人手牌可见]
        SyncState -.-> AnyPhase

        %% “任意阶段”锚点：用于表达侧向事件，不参与主干执行
        ForcedBets -.-> AnyPhase
        StreetPre -.-> AnyPhase
        StreetFlop -.-> AnyPhase
        StreetTurn -.-> AnyPhase
        StreetRiver -.-> AnyPhase
        Showdown -.-> AnyPhase
